          "contentAsciiDoc": "=== Modulation of the Iris Multivector Generator \\( \\iota \\)\nRational aperture scale factors \\( r = p / q \\) directly modulate the Iris field operator defined in Postulate 9: \\[ \\iota ( r , \\theta ) = r \\left ( \\cos \\theta \\cdot \\mathbf { 1 } _ { Cl } + \\sin \\theta \\cdot e _ { 12 } \\right ) + \\sqrt { 1 - r ^ 2 } \\cdot \\varpi \\vartheta \\]\n\n\nVarying the rational aperture ratio \\( r \\) adjusts the central flux transmission while maintaining the quadratic perimeter boundary constraint \\( \\iota ^ 2 = - \\mathbf { 1 } + \\varpi \\vartheta \\).\n\n[#chap-the-real-numbers]"
